    "body": "part 2 on vilts:issue/261-refused-location · PR #678 (draft) · pinned by refusal_location::{a_refused_hole_names_its_mouth_in_world, the_spot_is_the_hole_the_refusal_is_about, a_refusal_about_no_spot_names_none}, face_holes::the_narrow_strip_refusal_points_at_the_strip, refusal_focus_tests::{a_refused_generation_marks_its_spot_and_caches_nothing, the_mark_retires_with_the_refusal}, cross_spindle::tests::a_located_kernel_refusal_lands_on_the_world_mouth · quick gate green · merges at the next cut (feat).\n\nScope is the triage's middle ground: a refused generation marks the spot its refusal names (viewport cross plus a clickable refusal line); no partial path is drawn, so nothing refused can post. Remaining refusal sites: #677. The PR says Refs #261, not Fixes, so the maintainer can decide whether drawing a partial path keeps this open.\n\n(Outside contributor: I can't set labels. Please swap `claimed` for `in-review` and label #677: `enhancement`, `P2`, `area:ui`, `area:2d`, `source:agent`.)",
